note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note native/univ/spdna.om: Pure-Omega OLLMBF01 + OLLMSP02 DNA strand engine & spguard evaluator.
note Supports CPU (spdna_nogpu.om) and GB10 SM121 GPU (bf_dna.om) through dn_be_* hooks.
note Error exit codes: 2=usage/CLI, 60=bad format/magic/EOF, 61=FNV checksum mismatch, 62=trunk_hash mismatch, 70=I/O/OOM.

